    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/bb4a90c5-7861-4ff8-8ea7-234a5129a094-01/GreenProcurement$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot2_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_StrategicProcurement1>,
